                      <FontSize>0.8</FontSize>
                      <Text>            = Welcome! =
 Please apprise yourself
 of our server rules. Not
 reading them isn't an
 excuse for breaking them.
 
 Use the facilities here
 to make a ship! You have
 40,000 PCU to work with.
 
 You can also upload a
 blueprint to workshop
 (or bp.sbc to a filehost)
 and use !paste &lt;URL&gt;
 
 These projection tables
 can also be used to 
 construct ships. viktor
 please edit this</Text>
